{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WildType</strong> is a unique app that blends <strong>Retro Style</strong> with <strong>Powerful Feedback</strong>. It is built for both typing practice and creative writing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal is simple:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>\u2014\u2014 &quot;Make typing feel as exciting as a fighting game.&quot;</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Typing with &quot;Impact&quot;</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy high-energy visual effects and finishers. Every keystroke feels like a move in a fighting game, turning writing into a rhythmic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Retro Desktop Style</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tribute to the classic Windows 95 look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Pro Markdown Support</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful and powerful. Full support for Markdown helps you take notes and create content quickly and efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Master Your &quot;Muscle Memory&quot;</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improve Your Skills:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the built-in practice system to increase your speed while enjoying cool effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Typing Calendar:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your history and daily progress. Watch yourself grow from a beginner into a pro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in Input Methods:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Pinyin, Wubi, and more. Meet your Chinese input needs without installing extra software.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Developer\u2019s Message</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love mechanical keyboards, writing, or indie games, give <strong>WildType</strong> a try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please add it to your Wishlist\u2014it truly helps independent developers!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3410040?t=1772211080","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3410040?t=1772211080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410040/029aa3524ab4b9515909b25ded0f9a85554cbcad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772211080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410040/029aa3524ab4b9515909b25ded0f9a85554cbcad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772211080","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3420610,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WildType</strong> is a unique app that blends <strong>Retro Style</strong> with <strong>Powerful Feedback</strong>. It is built for both typing practice and creative writing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal is simple:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>\u2014\u2014 &quot;Make typing feel as exciting as a fighting game.&quot;</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Typing with &quot;Impact&quot;</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy high-energy visual effects and finishers. Every keystroke feels like a move in a fighting game, turning writing into a rhythmic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Retro Desktop Style</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tribute to the classic Windows 95 look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Pro Markdown Support</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful and powerful. Full support for Markdown helps you take notes and create content quickly and efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Master Your &quot;Muscle Memory&quot;</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improve Your Skills:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the built-in practice system to increase your speed while enjoying cool effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Typing Calendar:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your history and daily progress. Watch yourself grow from a beginner into a pro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in Input Methods:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Pinyin, Wubi, and more. Meet your Chinese input needs without installing extra software.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Developer\u2019s Message</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love mechanical keyboards, writing, or indie games, give <strong>WildType</strong> a try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please add it to your Wishlist\u2014it truly helps independent developers!</strong></p>","developers":["xianrenak / xrak"],"genres":[{"description":"Education","id":"54"},{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410040/936d7af2337bed7a90980b2f0ae76f88198678aa/header.jpg?t=1772211080","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 mb video memory</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"